WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
Blender Foundation presents a Peach open movie.

00:03.400 --> 00:07.200
Dawn in a forest. Three small birds share a branch.

00:07.200 --> 00:11.400
A huge rabbit, Big Buck Bunny, wakes and stretches in the grass.

00:11.400 --> 00:15.800
The birds flutter off. Two flying squirrels drop into the clearing.

00:15.800 --> 00:20.200
The rodents steal an apple and knock the rabbit flat for sport.

00:20.200 --> 00:25.000
The rabbit stands. His face hardens from soft to furious.

00:25.000 --> 00:29.400
He gathers himself for revenge as the forest holds still.

00:29.400 --> 00:33.000
Title card: Big Buck Bunny. A Creative Commons film.
